---
import ComplianceNote from '../../../components/compliance/ComplianceNote.astro';
import Button from '../../../components/global/Button.astro';
import HeroSplit from '../../../components/sections/HeroSplit.astro';
import PageLayout from '../../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import CTASection from '../../../components/cta/CTASection.astro';
import '../../../styles/contact-refined.css';
import { contactLinks, socialLinks } from '../../../data/externalLinks';

const contactOptions = [
  {
    title: 'WhatsApp',
    copy: 'The simplest way is a brief message on WhatsApp.',
    href: contactLinks.whatsapp.href,
    label: 'Message Me on WhatsApp',
  },
  {
    title: 'Call Directly',
    copy: contactLinks.phone.label,
    href: contactLinks.phone.href,
    label: 'Call Me',
  },
  {
    title: 'Send an Email',
    copy: contactLinks.email.label,
    href: contactLinks.email.href,
    label: 'Send an Email',
  },
  {
    title: 'In-Person Consultation in the Lüneburg District',
    copy: 'If you live in the Lüneburg district or nearby, we can also arrange to meet in person.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Online Consultation',
    copy: 'If meeting in person is not possible, we can also have the consultation conveniently by video call.',
  },
];
---

<PageLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Contact Kyle for doTERRA Guidance | Kyle Oils"
  description="Ask your questions about essential oils, starter kits and routines by WhatsApp, phone, email or, by arrangement, video call."
>
  <HeroSplit
    title="Let’s Talk"
    primaryHref={contactLinks.whatsapp.href}
    primaryLabel="Message Me on WhatsApp"
    secondaryHref="#contact-options"
    secondaryLabel="View Contact Options"
    imageSrc="/assets/images/about/contact-kyle-horse.jpg"
    imageAlt="Kyle with a horse in nature"
    imageWidth={1132}
    imageHeight={1390}
    imagePosition="50% 52%"
    imageSources={[
      { type: 'image/avif', srcset: '/assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-640.avif 640w, /assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-960.avif 960w' },
      { type: 'image/webp', srcset: '/assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-640.webp 640w, /assets/images/optimized/contact-kyle-horse-960.webp 960w' },
    ]}
  >
    <p>You do not need to know which oil, starter kit or routine is right for you yet.</p>
    <p>Simply tell me what interests you or what you would like help with. You can reach me by WhatsApp, phone or email. In-person meetings by arrangement and video calls are also possible.</p>
  </HeroSplit>

  <section id="contact-options" class="section contact-options" aria-labelledby="contact-options-heading">
    <div class="container contact-wrap">
      <header class="contact-heading" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">DIRECT & PERSONAL</p>
        <h2 id="contact-options-heading">Here is how to reach me.</h2>
        <p>Choose the way of getting in touch that feels best for you. I usually reply within 24 hours.</p>
      </header>
      <div class="contact-grid" data-consultation-cards>
        {contactOptions.slice(0, 3).map((option,index) => (
          <article class="contact-card" data-consultation-card>
            <div class="contact-card__top"><span class="contact-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2,"0")}</span><span class="contact-card__category">CONTACT METHOD</span></div>
            <h3>{option.title}</h3>
            {option.copy && <p>{option.copy}</p>}
            {option.href && option.label && <a href={option.href} class="contact-card__link"><span>{option.label}</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}
          </article>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="contact-formats">In-person meetings in the Lüneburg area and video calls are also possible by arrangement.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section local-guidance-section" aria-labelledby="local-guidance-heading">
    <div class="container contact-wrap">
      <div class="local-guidance-panel" data-reveal>
        <div class="local-guidance-panel__primary">
          <p class="eyebrow">GERMANY & ONLINE</p>
          <h2 id="local-guidance-heading">Meet locally. Or connect online.</h2>
          <p>If you are in the Lüneburg area, we can arrange to meet in person. A video call is also an option, in English or German. We can find what works for you.</p>
          <Button href="/en/essential-oil-guidance-germany/" variant="secondary">Explore guidance in Germany</Button>
        </div>
        <div class="local-guidance-panel__aside">
          <p class="eyebrow">FLEXIBLE CONNECTION</p>
          <h3>Not based near Lüneburg?</h3>
          <p>If you live elsewhere in Germany or abroad, we can still begin with a simple message or a video call.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="social-section" aria-labelledby="contact-social-heading">
    <div class="container contact-wrap social-layout" data-reveal>
      <div class="social-layout__heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">STAY CONNECTED</p>
        <h2 id="contact-social-heading">Find Kyle Oils on social media.</h2>
        <p>Everyday inspiration, simple routines and essential oil education.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href={socialLinks.facebook.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M14 8h3V4h-3c-3 0-5 2-5 5v2H6v4h3v7h4v-7h3l1-4h-4V9c0-.6.4-1 1-1Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Facebook</span>
        </a>
        <a href={socialLinks.linkedin.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6.5 8.5H3V21h3.5V8.5ZM4.8 3A2.1 2.1 0 1 0 5 7.2 2.1 2.1 0 0 0 4.8 3ZM21 14.1c0-3.8-2-5.9-4.8-5.9-2.2 0-3.2 1.2-3.8 2.1V8.5H9V21h3.5v-6.2c0-1.6.3-3.2 2.3-3.2s2 1.9 2 3.3V21H21v-6.9Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>LinkedIn</span>
        </a>
        <a href={socialLinks.instagram.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M7.5 2h9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 22 7.5v9a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5h-9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 2 16.5v-9A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 7.5 2Zm0 2A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 4 7.5v9A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 7.5 20h9a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 3.5-3.5v-9A3.5 3.5 0 0 0 16.5 4h-9ZM12 7a5 5 0 1 1 0 10 5 5 0 0 1 0-10Zm0 2a3 3 0 1 0 0 6 3 3 0 0 0 0-6Zm5.25-3.5a1.25 1.25 0 1 1 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 1 0-2.5Z"></path>
          </svg>
          <span>Instagram</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASection title="You do not need a plan yet." primaryHref={contactLinks.whatsapp.href} primaryLabel="Send me a WhatsApp message" secondaryHref="/en/consultation/" secondaryLabel="Learn about my guidance">
    <p>A brief message is enough. Tell me what interests you and I will help you find a sensible next step.</p>
  </CTASection>

  <section class="compliance-section contact-compliance">
    <div class="container">
      <ComplianceNote label="Note">
        <h2>A Brief Note</h2>
        <p>My support is not a substitute for medical diagnosis or treatment.<br />I do not claim that products can diagnose, treat or cure medical conditions.</p>
        <p>My focus is on clear guidance, practical daily routines, product information and personal support. For health concerns or medical questions, please consult an appropriately qualified professional.</p>
      </ComplianceNote>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script is:inline src="/scripts/consultation-motion.js" defer></script>
</PageLayout>
